        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a Steam version of a hit visual novel game released on the mobile reader app Love 365: Find Your Story by Voltage Inc. It is a collection of romantic, richly illustrated interactive stories with the following premise:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The protagonist? A hard-working rising star at a major advertising agency! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She's lived a driven, no-nonsense life thus far... until she wakes up from a party in an unfamiliar bed! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Who's next to her? And was it a fling or something more...?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a sensual, modern take on love that begins with a one-night stand. With a cast of attractive love interests and a sizzling start, this title is a long-time favorite among fans.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An opening movie and adventure feature have been added to the Steam release, so even players that have previously read the app version will discover more things to enjoy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In addition, some graphics and scenarios have been changed from the app version.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Story:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One morning, I wake up in an unfamiliar bed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Underwear on the floor… Rumpled sheets…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Did I spend the night with someone?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I decide to forget it ever happened, but then I get a text saying, “I want to see you again tonight”…</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can true love start with a one-night stand?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Characters:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shunichiro Tachibana &quot;Brilliant star of the agency&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toshiaki Kijima          &quot;A tough exec who takes his coffee black&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Toma Kiriya              &quot;A gifted and aloof copywriter&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Taku Hayama            &quot;A chance encounter&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Go Okubo                 &quot;A sweetheart on artist&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Contents:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Includes &quot;Main Stories&quot; in the app &quot;Love 365: Find Your Story,&quot; up until &quot;S3 Binding Hearts&quot;</p>",
